      "title": {
        "ja": "粘性チャネル／Poiseuille流",
        "en": "Viscous channel / Poiseuille"
      },
      "formula": "u(y) = G y(1−y)/(2ν); G=1, ν=0.1",
      "assumptions": {
        "ja": "十分に発達した平面定常チャネル、no-slip、単位密度。−dp/dx=G、または体積力加速度G。",
        "en": "Fully developed planar steady channel, no slip, unit density; −dp/dx=G or body acceleration G."
      },
      "relation": "related-model",
      "note": {
        "ja": "放物線形は共通ですが、計算は格子幅ny・目標最大速度0.01に応じた体積力、カードは単位幅・G=1・ν=0.1です。",
        "en": "Both have parabolic profiles, but the computation uses lattice height ny and forcing for peak speed 0.01; the card uses unit width, G=1 and ν=0.1."
      },
      "url": {
        "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/?lang=ja#/exact-solutions?case=poiseuille",
        "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/?lang=en#/exact-solutions?case=poiseuille"
      }
    }
  ],
  "reference_note": {
    "ja": "半格子bounce-back壁とGuo体積力を使う格子単位の放物線速度が解析基準です。参照解一覧の単位幅・G=1の流路とは駆動力と長さが異なります。",
    "en": "The analytic standard is the lattice-unit parabola with halfway bounce-back walls and Guo body forcing. The library unit-width channel with G=1 uses a different length and drive."
